.TH PIXELENS 1 "2026-07-20" "pixelens 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
pixelens \- Linux-native visual text extraction utility
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pixelens
[\fICOMMAND\fR] [\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B pixelens
captures a screen region, runs OCR, and copies the extracted text to the
clipboard. It talks to the
.B pixelensd
background daemon over IPC.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B grab
Capture a region and copy OCR text to the clipboard (default action).
.TP
.B copy
Copy the last captured text.
.TP
.B search
Open a reverse/web image search for the last capture.
.TP
.B ai
Run an AI prompt against the last capture.
.TP
.B translate
Translate the last captured text.
.TP
.B daemon
Control the background daemon (start|status|stop).
.TP
.B config
Inspect or set configuration (--endpoint|--model|--language|--hotkey).
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/pixelens/config.toml
User configuration (TOML).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR pixelensd (1)
.SH AUTHOR
km-rjun
